      <cyrillic>засаглах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ZASAΓLA-</transcript>
      <definition>v. i. and t. To act according to the law; to administer law, govern, to penalize</definition>
      <page>1040</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠵᠡᠨ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠶᠣᠰᠤᠨ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠵᠠᠰᠠᠬᠯᠠᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
